// Eraser diagram type: Flow Chart
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

User [shape: oval, icon: user]

Progress [icon: activity, color: blue] {
  Poll import every 1 to 2 seconds [icon: refresh-cw]
  Read counters from imports row [icon: hash]
  Read new import_events [icon: list]
}

Browse [icon: table, color: green] {
  Keyset page where id after cursor [icon: chevrons-right]
  50 contacts per page [icon: users]
}

Export [icon: download, color: purple] {
  COPY contacts TO STDOUT [icon: database]
  COPY import_errors TO STDOUT [icon: x-circle]
  Stream CSV to browser [icon: download-cloud]
}

Calling layer [shape: oval, icon: phone, color: gray]

User > Poll import every 1 to 2 seconds
Poll import every 1 to 2 seconds > Read counters from imports row: no COUNT star
Poll import every 1 to 2 seconds > Read new import_events
User > Keyset page where id after cursor: no OFFSET
Keyset page where id after cursor > 50 contacts per page
User > COPY contacts TO STDOUT
User > COPY import_errors TO STDOUT: rejected rows
COPY contacts TO STDOUT > Stream CSV to browser
COPY import_errors TO STDOUT > Stream CSV to browser
50 contacts per page > Calling layer: status pending
